{"root":{"data":{"id":"85cb98c910d5","created":1557391451,"text":"Prometheus"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btyp76g79y80","created":1557391465890,"text":"特点","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btyp7gz7x140","created":1557391488808,"text":"多维数据模型：用于保存时间序列数据，用指标（metrics）名和键值对区分","layout_right_offset":{"x":-2,"y":-11}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btypc4oqvko0","created":1557391853874,"text":"PromQL：灵活的查询语言"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btypd0lla540","created":1557391923340,"text":"不依赖分布式存储，单个服务器节点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btypdjygjgo0","created":1557391965477,"text":"时间序列数据集合，通过HTTP的PULL模型拉取"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btypv8hpqd40","created":1557393351075,"text":"通过中间件网关可以推送时间序列数据"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btypvuljc400","created":1557393399196,"text":"静态文件配置或动态服务查询，都可查找到目标"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btypxen9p9c0","created":1557393521200,"text":"支持多种图表、仪表盘"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btypyaluzeg0","created":1557393590772,"text":"组件","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btypzkqxjc80","created":1557393691211,"text":"Prometheus server服务器：可以抓取和存储时间序列数据"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btyq0uufcg00","created":1557393791554,"text":"客户端：检测应用的返回码"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btyq3e6ipjc0","created":1557393990372,"text":"推流网关：支持短期任务检测"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btyq3nwwp0w0","created":1557394011559,"text":"输出器：接收第三方系统存在的指标数据并输出"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btyqgnwfrfk0","created":1557395030265,"text":"报警器"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btyqgrpvfsg0","created":1557395038575,"text":"各种支持工具"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btyqhrhdoqg0","created":1557395116426,"text":"场景","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btyqhudk6i80","created":1557395122725,"text":"优势"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btyqi3fmd5s0","created":1557395142440,"text":"记录海量单一时间序列数据，适合监测机器和动态服务架构。\n支持多维数据集及其查询，尤适合监测微服务"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btyqnibfznc0","created":1557395566660,"text":"适合监测系统可靠性，快速判断问题；每个Prometheus的服务器是单点的，\n不依赖网络存储和其他远程服务。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btyqhxi532g0","created":1557395129532,"text":"劣势"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btyqsf4mb1c0","created":1557395951538,"text":"不适合监控精确度很高的数据，比如账户、付费系统"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"btyqvj9ve200","created":1557396195655,"text":"数据模型","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btyr743geog0","created":1557397102986,"text":"所有的数据都是时间序列，prometheus还会在查询时生成临时的派生时间序列\n相同的metrics(指标名称) 和label(一个或多个标签) 组成一条时间序列\n每条时间序列是由唯一的”指标名称”和一组”标签（key=value）”的形式组成"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btyrtowaa9c0","created":1557398872276,"text":"metric name指标名称，一般给监测对象起一个名字"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btyrunshr3k0","created":1557398948234,"text":"label标签就是对一条时间序列不同维度的识别"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btys2w1w7nk0","created":1557399593130,"text":"e.g.\nhttp_requests_total{method=”POST”,endpoint=”/api/tracks”}\nhttp_requests_total是metric name，method=\"POST\"就是一个标签的key/value\n按数据库理解，metric_name是表名，标签是字段，timestamp是主键，所有字段的值都是float64"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btyrm9nowwg0","created":1557398290556,"text":"数据类型","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btys5dqblk00","created":1557399788341,"text":"counter：用于累计值，例如记录请求次数、任务完成数、错误发生次数。一直增加，不会减少。重启进程后，会被重置。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btys5gv6thk0","created":1557399795166,"text":"gauge：常规数值，例如 温度变化、内存使用变化。可变大，可变小。重启进程后，会被重置。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btys5j190ao0","created":1557399799886,"text":"histogram：直方图可以理解为柱状图的意思，常用于跟踪事件发生的规模，例如：请求耗时、响应大小。\n它特别之处是可以对记录的内容进行分组，提供count和sum全部值的功能。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btys5mhyoqw0","created":1557399807427,"text":"summary：Summary和Histogram十分相似，常用于跟踪事件发生的规模，例如：请求耗时、响应大小。同样提供 count 和 sum 全部值的功能。\n它提供一个quantiles的功能，可以按%比划分跟踪的结果。例如：quantile取值0.95，表示取采样值里面的95%数据。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bu30gy0tu4w0","created":1557829503224,"text":"Alertmanager"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bu30h0wd4h40","created":1557829509484,"text":"机制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bu30iyofrcg0","created":1557829661380,"text":"分组：将同一类型的警报合并，多个同类警报只产生一封邮件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bu30kemnu8g0","created":1557829774465,"text":"抑制Inhibition：停止重复发送由此警报引发其他错误的警报的机制。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bu30xb84qw00","created":1557830785790,"text":"沉默：特定时间不告警"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bu30h1bhehk0","created":1557829510398,"text":"方式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bu30xhlsbm80","created":1557830799676,"text":"通过配置文件来定义规则"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bu30h1jgskw0","created":1557829510881,"text":"发送报警通知"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bu311novpk80","created":1557831126381,"text":"slack/email/wechat/..."},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}